  {
    "segmentnr":"SA_GS25_desinamamalu:15",
    "original":"lakṣaṇē śabdaśāstrē siddhahēmacandranāmni yē na siddhāḥ prakr̥tipratyayādivibhāgēna na niṣpannāstē 'tra nibaddhāḥ. yē tu bajjara-pajjara-upphāla-pisuṇa-saṅgha-bōlla-cava-jampa-sīsa-sāhādayaḥ kathyādīnāmādēśatvēna sādhitas [siddhahēmacandram, 4, 2] tē 'nyairdēśīṣu parigr̥hītā apyasmābhirna nibaddhāḥ. yē ca satyāmapi prakr̥tipratyayādivibhāgēna siddhau saṁskr̥tābhidhānakōśēṣu na prasiddhāstē’py atra nibaddhāḥ. yathā–. amr̥tanirgama-cchinnōdbhavā-prahānaṭādayaścandra-dūrvā-harādiṣvarthēṣu. yē ca saṁskr̥tābhidhāna-kōśēṣv aprasiddhā api gauṇyā lakṣaṇayā vālaṅkāra-cūḍāmaṇi-pratipāditayā śaktyā sambhavanti. yathā–mūrkhē baïllō, gaṅgātaṭē gaṅgā-śabdas. ta iha dēśīśabdasaṅgrahē na nibaddhāḥ || [3].",
